# ============================================================
# Go (https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Go.gitignore)
# ============================================================

# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
/mlmforge

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov
*.prof

# Go build cache, when GOCACHE is pointed inside the repo. Agents and sandboxed
# runs do this when the default cache location is unwritable. It is large
# (100MB+) and regenerable, so it must never be committed. Delete it when idle —
# ignoring it stops the commit, not the disk usage.
.gocache/

# Go workspace files
go.work
go.work.sum

# Dependency directories
# vendor/

# ============================================================
# Rust (https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Rust.gitignore)
# ============================================================

# Compiled files and executables
debug/
target/

# Rustfmt backup files
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC debug symbols
*.pdb

# Mutation testing output
**/mutants.out*/

# ============================================================
# Build output
# ============================================================
/bin/
/dist/

# ============================================================
# IDE / Editor
# ============================================================
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ============================================================
# OS
# ============================================================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ============================================================
# Environment / Secrets
# ============================================================
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json

# ============================================================
# Project internal — development process docs and tooling
# ============================================================
.claude/
.antigravitycli/
.cgcignore
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
BUGS_AND_TODOS.md
VERSION_HISTORY.md
DEVELOPMENT.md
ACCESSIBILITY.md
CHANGELOG.md

# Most of docs/ is working material that should not ship: plans, handoff
# notes, review transcripts, audits, and third-party compensation-plan PDFs.
# Ignore the contents by default and opt subtrees in one at a time.
#
# This ignores docs/* (the contents), not docs/ itself. Git does not descend
# into an excluded directory, so "docs/" plus a negation would not work.
#
# A NEW subdirectory under docs/ is invisible until it gets a line here. That
# is deliberate: docs stay private until someone opts them in. See HEU-551.
docs/*
!docs/development/
!docs/use-cases/

# Git worktrees
.worktrees/

# Legacy reference codebase
osMLM/
